            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "Found the answer for the first point. Not sure if it is recommended, but this will work:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\ncustom_surroundings = {\r\n  f = { input = {}, output = {} },\r\n}\r\n```",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Found the answer for the first point. Not sure if it is recommended, but this will work:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"custom_surroundings = {\n  f = { input = {}, output = {} },\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">custom_surroundings</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">f</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">input</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {}, <span class=\"pl-smi\">output</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {} },\n}</pre></div>",
            "bodyText": "Found the answer for the first point. Not sure if it is recommended, but this will work:\ncustom_surroundings = {\n  f = { input = {}, output = {} },\n}",
